					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					266
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμήλους ταχυτῆτι οὐ λειπομένας ἵππων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.86
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύνεσιν οὐδενὸς λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.72
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήθει λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.4.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήθει ἡμῶν λειφθέντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>An.</u>
					7.7.31
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ ἔτι θηρὸς ἐλείπετο
				δερκομένοισιν</span>, i.e. resembled . . , Epic.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				7p.4
			</span></i>: also c. gen. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειφθῆναι μάχης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Heracl.</u>
					732
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν σοῦ ξίφους λελείψομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1041
				</span></i>
			: Math., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐγγραφὲν τοῦ
				περιγραφέντος ἐλάσσονι λείπεται</span> the inscribed
			figure <i>falls short of</i> the circumscribed by less than . . ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Archim.
				<u>Con.Sph.</u>
				21
			</span></i>: also c. dat. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειφθῆναι μάχῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					344
				</span></i>
			: c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἐμοῦ λείπει γιγνώσκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					18.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέλειψαι τῶν ἐμῶν βουλευμάτων</span>
